{"t":"EXPD","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Expeditors International of Washington, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","employees":20463,"hq":"Bellevue, WA, United States","website":"https://www.expeditors.com","summary_en":"Expeditors International of Washington, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides logistics services in the Americas, North Asia, South Asia, Europe, and Middle East, Africa, and India. The company offers airfreight services, such as air freight consolidation and forwarding; ocean freight and ocean services, including ocean freight consolidation, direct ocean forwarding, and order management; customs brokerage and other services, import, intra-continental ground transportation and delivery, and warehousing and distribution services; and customs clearance, purchase order management, vendor consolidation, time-definite transportation services, temperature-controlled transit, cargo insurance, specialized cargo monitoring and tracking, and other logistics solutions. It also provides optimization, trade compliance consulting, cargo insurance, cargo security, and solutions. In addition, it acts as a freight consolidator or as an agent for the airline that carries the shipment. Further, the company provides ancillary services that include preparation of shipping and customs documentation, packing, crating, insurance services, and the preparation of documentation to comply with local export and import laws. The company was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Bellevue, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Expeditors International of Washington, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미주, 북아시아, 남아시아, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 인도에서 물류 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 항공 화물 통합 및 운송과 같은 항공 화물 서비스를 제공합니다. 해상 화물 통합, 직접 해상 운송 및 주문 관리를 포함한 해상 화물 및 해상 서비스; 통관 중개 및 기타 서비스, 수입, 대륙 내 지상 운송 및 배송, 창고 및 유통 서비스; 통관, 구매 주문 관리, 공급업체 통합, 정시 운송 서비스, 온도 조절 운송, 화물 보험, 전문 화물 모니터링 및 추적, 기타 물류 솔루션 등이 있습니다. 또한 최적화, 무역 규정 준수 컨설팅, 화물 보험, 화물 보안 및 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 화물 통합업체 또는 화물을 운송하는 항공사의 대리인 역할을 합니다. 또한 회사는 배송 및 통관 서류 준비, 포장, 상자 포장, 보험 서비스, 현지 수출입 법률을 준수하기 위한 서류 준비를 포함한 보조 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1979년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴주 벨뷰에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":188.87,"mcap":24385132544.0,"pe":23.99873,"fpe":21.834555,"peg":3.1312,"ps":1.8405402,"pb":10.450396,"ev_ebitda":17.164,"div":0.86,"beta":1.068,"hi52":207.93,"lo52":129.59},"fin":{"rev":13248900096.0,"rev_g":0.419,"eps_g":0.616,"gross":0.13313,"op":0.10844,"net":0.07858,"roe":0.45082,"fcf":772849280.0,"cash":1092464000.0,"debt":575835008.0,"de":24.569,"eps":7.87,"feps":8.65005},"own":{"short":0.0421,"inst":1.01135,"insider":0.00638},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":189.46667,"median":190.0,"high":240.0,"low":100.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.16667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":4,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":4,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":4,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":4,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":245.0,"priorPriceTarget":220.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":220.0,"priorPriceTarget":214.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":175.0,"priorPriceTarget":165.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":175.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-05","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":214.0,"priorPriceTarget":200.0},